== Notes about this bill

*Estimated reading.* We could not read your meter this month, so your October reading was estimated from your usage in the same month last year. If you think the estimate is too high, send us an actual meter reading within 14 days of the bill date and we will send you a corrected bill.

*Price change.* Our Home Standard unit price changed on 1 October 2026. The standing charge did not change. See the enclosed tariff sheet for details.

*How to send a reading.* Write to Kestrelby Energy, Customer Readings, PO Box 4410, Fernhall, with your account number, the reading and the date you took it. You can also include a photo of your meter.

*Questions about your bill.* Write to us at the address above. Please quote your account number.
